</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>config</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The .ini-domain customization points to use. <bold>Default</bold>: \ref defaultConfig </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
